into the machine.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:36.430
So as you can see, I can
see the serial number

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:40.240
of the machine, operating
system of the OS, which is Mac--

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:42.250
this is the Mac machine.

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:43.570
How much is the cache size?

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:47.140
I just now downloaded
more than 100 MB.

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:50.110
What is the Drive
File Stream version?

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:53.890
When it was it first synced,
when it was last synced?

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:56.350
On the left side, I
can take actions--

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:57.970
like block the device--

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:00.890
so that whatever
data is present,

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:02.740
it will be removed
from that device.

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:06.640
And no further access will
be allowed from that device.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:09.260
I can wipe the account one
time, so that one time,

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:10.930
data is removed from the device.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:15.010
I can delete the device, or I
can remove all the information

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:18.790
of the device so that what's
happening on the device

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:21.650
is visible, very easy.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:25.030
So, as you can see, let
me block the device.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:27.730
You can see on the
right side what happens.

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:29.050
So let me block it.

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:36.650
And one device is blocked.

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:40.010
Boom, all the data from
the device is gone.

00:13:40.010 --> 00:13:42.590
Administrator has
blocked this device--

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:45.950
from this computer-- so that
I can no longer access it

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.510
and the device data is gone.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.874
As Brad mentioned, we
are launching this today.

